WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.440
What happens to yellow fabric&nbsp;
when it's placed into SCP-914?

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:09.900
Researcher Salis selected one spool of yellow&nbsp;
fabric for experimentation with the Clockworks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:13.980
The fabric was placed into the machinery&nbsp;
on the setting "Fine." The output produced&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:19.740
was one yellow hoodie that appears black when&nbsp;
exposed to light leves of 0.002 lux or higher.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:24.840
When not exposed to sufficient levels of&nbsp;
light, the outfit glows at 15,000 lumens.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:30.180
Research staff were rendered temporarily blind&nbsp;
during testing, and the hoodie was incinerated.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:34.920
Researcher Salis noted, “The clothing&nbsp;
seems to act as a "light sponge" of sorts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:40.080
absorbing light during normal conditions and&nbsp;
releasing it when the surrounding area gets dark.”

